WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.421
The three angles inside any triangle always add up to one hundred eighty degrees.

00:06.871 --> 00:12.235
Say two angles are fifty and sixty degrees. We want the third one.

00:12.685 --> 00:18.327
First add the two angles we know. Fifty plus sixty is one hundred ten.

00:18.777 --> 00:26.022
Then take that away from one hundred eighty. One hundred eighty minus one hundred ten is seventy.

00:26.472 --> 00:34.204
So the third angle is seventy degrees. Check: fifty plus sixty plus seventy is one hundred eighty.
